# Local-only sprite atlas (rip-derived, never committed)
/atlas/

# Vendored third-party repos cloned for RE reference (e.g. ModNao NaomiLib/PVR
# decoder, github.com/rob2d/modnao). Never commit a vendored repo.
_vendor/
# HD / rip-derived per-character atlases used by the sprite-client demo
# (web/hd-cable-demo.html). Real-ESRGAN-upscaled MvC2 sprites = derivative art.
web/test-atlas/chars/
# Ripped stage backgrounds (STGxxPOL/TEX disc-derived geometry + textures) served
# to web/stage-test.html. Disc-derived — never committed.
web/test-atlas/stages/
# Render-replica LOCAL-ROM GFX cache (Phase A): per-char raw GFX1/GFX2 segments
# (PL{NN}_gfx1.bin / PL{NN}_gfx2.bin) = byte-identical disc/RAM art the client overlays
# at node+0x15C/0x160. ROM-derived — never committed; staged locally, served from /gfx.
web/render-replica/gfx/
# Render-replica EFFECTS atlas (Phase 3): Effect-Poly bank 0x0CED0000 decoded sprites
# (effects.png / effects.json keyed by directory idx). ROM-derived — never committed;
# built offline by tools/build_replica_effects_atlas.py, served from /effects.
web/render-replica/effects/
# Effect-Poly fx_atlas (sprite-keyed bake of the 25 Effect-Poly dir textures, dual-keyed
# by directory idx 0..24 AND effect_key=(0x0CED03D8+idx*0x10)&0xFFFF). Consumed by
# sprite-client.mjs loadFxAtlas() in the emitter effects pass. ROM-derived — never committed.
web/test-atlas/effects/

# Assembly-driven part-atlas capture outputs (ROM-derived, never committed)
# Probe writes to /dev/shm; packer writes PL??_parts.png / PL??_asm.json / *_composite.png
PL[0-9A-Fa-f][0-9A-Fa-f]_parts.png
PL[0-9A-Fa-f][0-9A-Fa-f]_parts.json
PL[0-9A-Fa-f][0-9A-Fa-f]_asm.json
PL[0-9A-Fa-f][0-9A-Fa-f]_composite*.png
PL[0-9A-Fa-f][0-9A-Fa-f]_part_*.ppm
PL[0-9A-Fa-f][0-9A-Fa-f]_part_*.raw
PL[0-9A-Fa-f][0-9A-Fa-f]_part_*.png
PL[0-9A-Fa-f][0-9A-Fa-f]_extras.bin
PL[0-9A-Fa-f][0-9A-Fa-f]_parts.manifest
